('node-1-4', 'phase-01-lesson-04-encapsulation-private-attribute-conventio', 'module-2', 4, 'Lesson 2.4: Encapsulation & Private Attribute Conventions', 'Prerequisites: Lesson 1.2', 'Prerequisites: Lesson 1.2 | Subtopics: 4 items', 'Systems project application', 120, 2, 310.0, 200.0, '# Lesson 1.4: Encapsulation & Private Attribute Conventions

- **Status**: `[State: Active | Complete Specification | Core]`
